# aie-ptr-mod-opt plans an offset combine of %6 = G_LOAD %5 placed at the
# post-increment load of %2. ptr_add_immed_chain then folds
# %5 = G_PTR_ADD %2, 64 into G_PTR_ADD %0, 66 with a new G_CONSTANT that the
# planned move does not include. The offset load must not use it before its def.

